# issue: none
# notes: query-fuzz gen v1, world seed 3309, case 0; the edition-2 text, expectations blessed from EDITION-2
# notes: the generated world ran `omnigraph index build` after its load; this case does not

--- runner
timeout_ms: 10000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- schema
node Org {
  tags: I32
}
node Person {
  body: String @index
  size: Blob?
  content: enum(a, b)
}
node Tag {
  code: I32 @key
}
edge Likes: Org -> Org
edge Knows: Org -> Tag
edge Cites: Org -> Person @card(0..1) {
  w: String?
}

--- seed
{"type":"Org","id":"o0","data":{"tags":100}}
